line":{"value":"Fino a che morte non ci separi...","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2021-02-11","status":"Released","rating":6.6,"ratingCount":194,"genres":["Horror"],"countries":["Russia"],"facts":{"Runtime":"93m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":2097313,"name":"Yana Enzhaeva","role":"Zhenya","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8TfHZVzXDNmTUbixzmnFNr86Kd6.jpg"},{"id":2202678,"name":"Konstantin Beloshapka","role":"Kir","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nxF11Rue0ILN8B5q7l5drxJbMJW.jpg"},{"id":1626928,"name":"Ilya Ermolov","role":"Viktor","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s3kxd1znLcBSjMBBGYH8AcIVWZZ.jpg"},{"id":2759180,"name":"Nikita Yuranov","role":"Oleg"},{"id":2017467,"name":"Varvara Borodina","role":"Sonya","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xqCpLus2WI7ktx2PWitlcwkLMrk.jpg"},{"id":228262,"name":"Sabina Akhmedova","role":"Aza the Gypsy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/knWGJWSQFpPz2UiGjZmWFXIEeU1.jpg"},{"id":1987301,"name":"Larysa Domaskina","role":"Zhenya's Mother","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/taslC4TdoMbIvtQowKOHDRcB8vY.jpg"},{"id":1642332,"name":"Andrey Zavodyuk","role":"Kir's Father","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jUd4zJmKXP8FQAig4FGojKol5P4.jpg"},{"id":1797367,"name":"Anna Vartanyan","role":"Kir's Mother","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qHnrreZUtiaFZT6ZZUM6f96Oeyo.jpg"},{"id":2233623,"name":"Alla Malkova","role":"Old Gipsy Woman","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pYHpigkWeyFhzkJbwVKJ8eYj6QH.jpg"},{"id":1034698,"name":"Igor Khripunov","role":"Pastor","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k9Nw2mZlLAtbZOJdTmnbX4Vj8hK.jpg"},{"id":2282388,"name":"Maksim Bramatkin","role":"Morgue Attendant","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hSiTqYxnJM3ArZvtCozo80E0vDb.jpg"},{"id":4901504,"name":"Aleksey Klimenko","role":"Polina"},{"id":4901505,"name":"Nikita Klimenko","role":"Polina"},{"id":4901506,"name":"Nikol Koreneva","role":"Polina"},{"id":2298899,"name":"Alena Akimova","role":"Receptionist","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sHdvQY9musudzA8ayf001DwsfHN.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Dark Spell - Il maleficio","overview":"Dark Spell è la storia di una ragazza di nome Zhenya che soffre perché suo marito l'ha lasciata. Disperata la ragazza lancia un incantesimo chiamato \"Black Wedding\", che è un rituale magico conosciuto per il suo grande potere e irreversibilità. Dopo il rituale il suo amato marito torna, ma non è più lo stesso. Ossessionato da questo amore innaturale è persino pronto ad uccidere Zhenya per gelosia. Quando poi un triste giorno il marito muore accade l'imprevisto: l'incantesimo non si ferma...","tagline":"Fino a che morte non ci separi..."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Dark Spell","overview":"Terror strikes when a heartbroken woman uses black magic to get her husband back.","tagline":"Until Death Tears Them Apart"},{"language":"ru-RU","overview":"Женю бросает мужчина, которого она любит больше жизни. Не в силах смириться девушка решается на отчаянный шаг: цыганка рассказывает ей, как провести ритуал черного венчания и сделать приворот на любовь. И Кирилл возвращается! Им еще никогда не было так хорошо вместе, влюбленные не могут оторваться друг от друга, но с каждым днем страсть Кирилла все больше походит на пугающую одержимость.","tagline":"Даже смерть не разлучит их"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6UAOQKbULatCWVr6MI0Hvnu0D9i.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o2OSpKzXuB1edCDyVC2MXAxXwyJ.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":633802,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"ru-RU","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6UAOQKbULatCWVr6MI0Hvnu0